OL,3,GNEWSAExperts explore returning beavers
OL,4,Ato River Waveney
OL,5,
OL,6,FA river separating two counties could
OL,7,Fbecome home to beavers as work begins
OL,8,Fto explore where a colony could be
OL,9,Fintroduced.
OL,11,FThe River Waveney Trust is in
OL,12,Fconversation with Natural England and
OL,13,Fother agencies about potentially
OL,14,Freintroducing the river-dwelling
OL,15,Fmammals along the River Waveney.
OL,17,FThe 59-mile (95km) waterway rises in
OL,18,FRedgrave and Lopham Fen in Suffolk and
OL,19,Fheads east, creating a border between
OL,20,FNorfolk and Suffolk as it flows out
OL,21,Finto the River Yare at Great Yarmouth.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
