OL,3,GNEWSAExperts explore returning beavers
OL,4,Ato River Waveney
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnge Lamb, catchment resilience
OL,7,Fofficer, said the upper reaches of the
OL,8,FRiver Waveney and its tributaries could
OL,9,Fmake ideal environments for beavers. If
OL,10,Fsuccessful, beavers could return by
OL,11,F2029.
